WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.187
A responsive page changes its layout to fit any screen.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.465
First, add the viewport meta tag, or phones show a tiny zoomed-out page.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:15.877
Design for phones first: one column, big text, large buttons.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:20.834
Then use media queries to change the layout on bigger screens.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.624
And always test on a real phone.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:35.186
Before you move on, check: Add the viewport meta tag. Write phone styles first. Add one media query for wider screens. Test on a real phone.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:39.287
In the next lesson: Forms and accessibility.
